title: iris_intro_lobby_ambush
---
<<show_narration "The lobby wasn't empty anymore. Four of them under the dead ceiling panels, still wet through the shoulders, which meant they'd come in off the street after I did.">>
<<show_narration "One was doing the talking. Short sentences, no names, hands doing the work the words weren't. The other three moved when he stopped.">>
<<show_narration "They'd put themselves between me and the doors. Whatever else the night was paying them for, that part was the job.">>
<<set $office_encounter2_complete = true>>
